======================================================================================================================
  L2  (A) THE 3-PARAMETER FLOOR -- thin disc mass, thick disc mass, COMMON scale length
======================================================================================================================
  the thick disc carries its mass at z_d = 900 pc, so it can feed v_c while loading the |z| < 1.1 kpc
  column less than the thin disc does. If the over-delivery is a baryon-model artefact, this is where
  it should break.

  3p FLOOR, footing canon: 73.68 Msun/pc^2   (2p was 75.61)
    f_thin = 0.4000  f_thick = 3.1609  f_R = 0.9100   (z_d = 300 pc)
