  4p FLOOR, footing alt: 75.90 Msun/pc^2   (3p 77.76, 2p 79.88)   z_d wanted = 924 pc = +12.5 sigma vs 300 +- 50
    f_thin = 0.4000  f_thick = 3.0000  f_R = 0.9500  f_zd = 3.0812   (z_d = 924 pc)
